WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
We are not the only ones whose business has been taken away by Lin Yu.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,110
The human blood confronted him earlier than we did.

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
Spend more than 20 yuan in our store from now on

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:10,140
Just give me a 50% off Baixue Coffee Coupon

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,140
He is planning to sell at a loss all the time.

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,210
The enemy of my enemy is my friend

7
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:16,210
Let’s suppress the Happy Convenience Store first.

8
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:18,850
Thank you, Uncle Dashan

9
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,040
Take your time and watch

10
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:23,000
I've been so busy these two days that I almost forgot

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Last month's salary

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You lose or lose

13
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,130
Needless to say

14
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,130
Brother, I believe you

15
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,990
Business has been good recently

16
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,990
starting from this month

17
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:31,990
Salary is calculated as 10,000

18
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,990
Brother, this is too much

19
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:34,990
Just six thousand

20
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:35,990
I'm the boss, listen to me

21
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,180
One more thing

22
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:41,180
Free up all the shelves and stuff over there.
